@startuml profiler_evidence_flow
title Profiler observation, terminal replies and immutable evidence
participant "Shared notification reactor" as reactor
participant "Preparation helper pool" as helper
participant "Profiler work / reducer" as work
participant "JVM trace listener" as listener
participant "Frozen result / coverage" as result
reactor -> work : begin(notification + arch, deadline)
work -> helper : bounded copied preparation job
loop reactor polls before original deadline
  reactor -> work : poll
  work -> helper : inspect completion without waiting
end
helper --> work : typed evidence / failure
alt ordinary observation
  work -> listener : bounded event frame
  listener -> listener : capture exact stack + record evidence
  listener --> work : typed 0xAC ACK outcome
  work --> reactor : Ready(CONTINUE)
else structural failure or ACK failure
  work --> reactor : Ready(terminal denial)
else noise
  work --> reactor : Ready(pass-through reply)
end
reactor -> reactor : sole CAS terminal lease\nSent / Gone / Failed
listener -> result : final immutable behavior + coverage
note over reactor,helper
  Deadline expiry: one EPERM attempt, cancel job, terminate session.
  Late result: dispose only; no publication or reply.
  Failed reap: retain occupied capacity and fail pool.
end note
note over listener,result
  ACK failure closes before reading next event.
  Protocol violation during drain stays incomplete.
  Complete drain alone is not complete collector evidence.
end note
@enduml
